Hanumān roams nimbly toward sun-walled Rāvaṇa palace --- Hanumān admires jewel chariot elephant crowded palace --- Hanumān leaps through houses of Prahasta Mahāpārśva Kumbhakarṇa Vibhīṣaṇa --- Hanumān passes Mahōdara Virūpākṣa Vidyujjihva Vidyunmāli Vajradaṃṣṭra --- Hanumān visits Śuka Sāraṇa Indrajit Jambumāli Sumāli and others --- Hanumān returns to Rāvaṇa palace past spear Rākṣasīs elephants chariots --- Hanumān views palanquins bowers playhouses treasure and wine-scented hall
